#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/hardening/logging.rst:400
msgid ""
"Eight lines into every log file, the operator knows the physical unit, the "
"firmware lineage, why the cam booted, and which storage came up. ``unique "
"id`` is the MCU's factory-programmed silicon serial number; it is the same "
"across reflashes and across SD-card swaps. ``build`` is the git tag and date"
" of the firmware tree the image was built from -- the single field that says"
" \"this is exactly the binary that shipped to this unit at this point in "
"time.\""
msgstr ""
"Delapan baris di setiap file log, operator mengetahui unit fisiknya, asal "
"usul firmware, mengapa kamera boot, dan penyimpanan mana yang berhasil "
"aktif. ``unique id`` adalah nomor seri silikon yang diprogram di pabrik pada"
" MCU; nilainya sama di seluruh flash ulang dan penggantian kartu SD. "
"``build`` adalah tag git dan tanggal pohon firmware yang digunakan untuk "
"membangun image -- satu-satunya field yang menyatakan \"ini adalah tepat "
"binary yang dikirimkan ke unit ini pada titik waktu ini.\""

